<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Dutch first</p>
<p>division soccer matches played on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Ajax Amsterdam 2 (Kluivert 13, Santos penalty 88) Fortuna</p>
<p>Sittard 2 (Burke 45, Ricksen 67). Halftime 1-1. Attendance</p>
<p>49,123.</p>
<p>Twente Enschede 5 (Ter Avest 62, Petrov 63, Ten Caat 65, Bosman</p>
<p>75, Ajupov 78) Willem II Tilburg 0. Halftime 0-0. Attendance</p>
<p>5,500.</p>
<p>Vitesse Arnhem 2 (Makaay penalty 66, Van den Brom 77) RKC</p>
<p>Waalwijk 2 (Alfred Schreuder 69, Starbuck 82). Halftime 0-0.</p>
<p>Attendance 6,000.</p>
<p>Roda JC Kerkrade 2 (Ooyer 20, Vurens 50) NEC Nijmegen 0.</p>
<p>Halftime 1-0. Attendance 6,000.</p>
<p>Played Tuesday:</p>
<p>Feyenoord 1 (Van Bronckhorst 53) NAC Breda 0. Halftime 0-0.</p>
<p>Attendance 24,000.</p>
<p>Heerenveen 2 (Dahl Tomasson 60, 62) Graafschap Doetinchem 1</p>
<p>(Vreeman 67). Halftime 0-0. Attendance 13,300.</p>
